formed about the implementation of the study, its objectives, its constraints, the rights of the patient and must have received the newsletter and no opposition of the study.\n-  The patient must be an affiliate or beneficiary of a health insurance plan.\n-  The patient is at least 18 years old.\n-  The patient has septic shock as defined by the 3rd International Conference for the definition of sepsis and septic shock\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "- The patient or his / her representative has been informed about the implementation of the study, its objectives, its constraints, the rights of the patient and must have received the newsletter and no opposition of the study."\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "raw_text": "- The patient must be an affiliate or beneficiary of a health insurance plan.",\n              "Insurance": [\n                "health insurance plan"\n              ]\n            }\n          }\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- The patient is at least 18 years old.",\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "at least 18 years"\n          ],\n          "Age": [\n            "old"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "at least"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "18"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "years"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- The patient has septic shock as defined by the 3rd International Conference for the definition of sepsis and septic shock",\n      "Condition": [\n        "sepsis",\n        "septic shock",\n        "shock"\n      ],\n      "Condition-Name": [\n        "sepsis",\n        "septic shock",\n        "shock"\n      ]\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
