ails.\n- all entities: \'Contraindication\', \'Eq-Value\', \'Severity\', \'Drug\', \'Observation-Name\', \'Age\', \'Location\', \'Organism-Name\', \'Encounter\', \'Drug-Name\', \'Ethnicity\', \'Modifier\', \'Condition\', \'Eq-Unit\', \'Eq-Temporal-Unit\', \'Family-Member\', \'Organism\', \'Other\', \'Immunization-Name\', \'Polarity\', \'Condition-Type\', \'Immunization\', \'Eq-Operator\', \'Eq-Temporal-Recency\', \'Procedure-Name\', \'Indication\', \'Exception\', \'Study\', \'Language\', \'Coreference\', \'Provider\', \'Acuteness\', \'Life-Stage-And-Gender\', \'Procedure\', \'Risk\', \'Death\', \'Assertion\', \'Allergy-Name\', \'Specimen\', \'Negation\', \'Code\', \'Stability\', \'Birth\', \'Criteria-Count\', \'Eq-Comparison\', \'Condition-Name\', \'Insurance\', \'Observation\', \'Allergy\', \'Eq-Temporal-Period\'\n- the lists for the entity\'s should only be appended if one or more entities have been found. Otherwise, omit the arrays completely.\n\n5. The JSON object should be containing the following rules:\n- Ensure that the same logical operator ("AND", "OR", "NOT") does not appear on the same level of the tree structure to maintain the integrity of the logical relationships.\n- Generates JSON files from the textual criteria and organizing them into the described logical structure.\n- Setting the brackets {}, [] and commas, correctly in the JSON is extremely important.\n- Any double quotes within the raw textual criteria are escaped with a backslash (\\").\n- If there are no restrictions, return an empty JSON FILE {}\n- The entire text of the eligibility criteria must be included and separated by the logical operators, without omitting any words or information.\n- The output should only contain the JSON object, without any additional text or formatting.\n- Ensure that the JSON output strictly follows these rules and accurately represents the logical structure of the input eligibility criteria.\n\n### Input:\n-  Eligible patients are those over 18 years of age who are regularly scheduled to undergo a right hemicolectomy via a minimally invasive approach (robotic or laparoscopic) with the creation of an anastomosis. Right colectomy will be defined as removal of the ascending colon, ligation of the ileocolic artery and vein, +/- removal of the terminal ileum, +/- removal of the proximal transverse colon, and +/- removal of the right branch of the middle colic artery and vein.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "OR": {\n    "left": {\n      "raw_text": "- Eligible patients are those over 18 years of age",\n      "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n        "years"\n      ],\n      "Age": [\n        "age"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Value": [\n        "18"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Comparison": [\n        "over 18 years"\n      ],\n      "Eq-Operator": [\n        "over"\n      ]\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "OR": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "who are regularly scheduled to undergo a right hemicolectomy via a minimally invasive approach (robotic",\n          "Procedure": [\n            "right hemicolectomy",\n            "minimally invasive approach"\n          ],\n          "Procedure-Name": [\n            "right hemicolectomy",\n            "minimally invasive approach"\n          ],\n          "Modifier": [\n            "robotic"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "scheduled to undergo"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Temporal-Period": [\n            "scheduled to undergo"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "OR": {\n            "left": {\n              "raw_text": "or laparoscopic) with the creation of an anastomosis. Right colectomy will be defined as removal of the ascending colon, ligation of the ileocolic artery",\n              "Procedure": [\n                "ligation"\n              ],\n              "Procedure-Name": [\n                "ligation"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "laparoscopic"\n              ],\n              "Condition": [\n                "Right colectomy",\n                "anastomosis"\n              ],\n              "Condition-Name": [\n                "Right colectomy",\n                "anastomosis"\n              ],\n              "Negation": [\n                "no"\n              ],\n              "Observation": [\n                "removal"\n              ],\n              "Observation-Name": [\n                "removal"\n              ],\n              "Modifier": [\n                "ascending colon",\n                "ileocolic artery"\n              ]\n            },\n            "right": {\n              "OR": {\n                "left": {\n                  "raw_text": "and vein, +/- removal of the terminal ileum,",\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "removal"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "removal"\n                  ],\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "vein",\n                    "terminal ileum"\n                  ]\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "OR": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "+/- removal of the proximal transverse colon,",\n                      "Observation": [\n                        "removal"\n                      ],\n                      "Observation-Name": [\n                        "removal"\n                      ],\n                      "Modifier": [\n                        "proximal transverse colon"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "OR": {\n                        "left": {\n                          "raw_text": "and +/- removal of the right branch of the middle colic artery",\n                          "Observation": [\n                            "removal"\n                          ],\n                          "Observation-Name": [\n                            "removal"\n                          ],\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "vein",\n                            "right branch of the middle colic artery"\n                          ]\n                        },\n                        "right": {\n                          "raw_text": "and vein.",\n                          "Modifier": [\n                            "vein"\n                          ]\n                        }\n                      }\n                    }\n                  }\n                }\n              }\n            }\n          }\n        }\n      }\n    }\n  }\n}<|eot_id|>']
