al clinical practice\n-  Neurogenic claudication\n-  Lumbar pain for more than 6 months\n-  Numerical rating scale >6\n-  No response with medical treatment\n-  No response with other interventional treatment: epidurolysis\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "AND": {\n            "left": {\n              "AND": {\n                "left": {\n                  "AND": {\n                    "left": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Patient with indication for epiduroscopy in the usual clinical practice",\n                      "Indication": [\n                        "indication"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure": [\n                        "epiduroscopy"\n                      ],\n                      "Procedure-Name": [\n                        "epiduroscopy"\n                      ]\n                    },\n                    "right": {\n                      "raw_text": "- Neurogenic claudication",\n                      "Condition": [\n                        "Neurogenic claudication"\n                      ],\n                      "Condition-Name": [\n                        "Neurogenic claudication"\n                      ]\n                    }\n                  }\n                },\n                "right": {\n                  "raw_text": "- Lumbar pain for more than 6 months",\n                  "Modifier": [\n                    "Lumbar"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation": [\n                    "pain"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Comparison": [\n                    "more than 6 months"\n                  ],\n                  "Observation-Name": [\n                    "pain"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Operator": [\n                    "more than"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Value": [\n                    "6"\n                  ],\n                  "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n                    "