sed with rheumatoid arthritis according to ACR / EULAR 2010 criteria.\n-  Patients with moderate to high disease activity (DAS - 28. score greater than 3.2)\n-  Patients received the standard therapy (i.e. one or more conventional DMARDs) for at least three months.\n\n### Response:\n{\n  "AND": {\n    "left": {\n      "AND": {\n        "left": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients older than 18 years (of both sexes) diagnosed with rheumatoid arthritis according to ACR / EULAR 2010 criteria.",\n          "Eq-Temporal-Unit": [\n            "years"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "18"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "older than 18 years"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "older than"\n          ],\n          "Condition": [\n            "rheumatoid arthritis"\n          ],\n          "Condition-Name": [\n            "rheumatoid arthritis"\n          ],\n          "Age": [\n            "older"\n          ]\n        },\n        "right": {\n          "raw_text": "- Patients with moderate to high disease activity (DAS - 28. score greater than 3.2)",\n          "Eq-Operator": [\n            "greater than",\n            "to"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Value": [\n            "3.2"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Comparison": [\n            "greater than 3.2",\n            "moderate to high"\n          ],\n          "Observation": [\n            "DAS",\n            "disease activity"\n          ],\n          "Observation-Name": [\n            "DAS",\n            "disease activity"\n          ],\n          "Severity": [\n            "moderate",\n            "high"\n          ],\n          "Eq-Unit": [\n            "score"\n          ]\n        }\n      }\n    },\n    "right": {\n      "raw_text": "- Patients received the standard therapy (i.e. one or more conventional DMARDs) for at least three months.",\n      "Procedure": [\n        "standard therapy"\n      ],\n      "Procedure-Name": [\n        "standard therapy